 # tags: rfd:feature, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2240  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-08T00:00:02Z (RFD66606-2240) 'every repository that ships a deliverable; `2-contract/manuals-weftspun` (the converter and its gate), the three CineForm repositories, and the `CITATION.cff` beside every placed project
 # tags: rfd:scope, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2240  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-08T00:00:03Z (RFD66606-2240) 'One citation record is the master, and every asset's metadata derives from it.
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD2240  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-08T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-2240) 'A `.cff` beside a clip is separated from it the first time either is copied, and no editor or player reads YAML attribution.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2240  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-08T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-2240) 'Run `mix cff.xmp` with `--check` on a sidecar to catch a stale derivation, and read below for the mapping matrix and the precedence rules.
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD2240  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-08T00:00:06Z (RFD66606-2240) 'One citation, one metadata serialization, one vector pair, one intermediate, one review timeline
 # tags: rfd:details-title, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2240  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-08T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-2240) '`CITATION.cff` stays the master attribution record and every other metadata artefact is derived from it. The machine serialization is ISO 16684-1 (XMP) as RDF/XML, in a sidecar named for the asset's own stem, so a clip, a drawing or an animation carries its title, authors, licence and identifier wherever it travels. Static vector is W3C SVG, animated vector is Lottie under its IANA type `video/lottie+json` with the extension `.lot`, the intermediate is CineForm, and a review timeline is OpenTimelineIO with OpenColorIO naming the display. The converter is Elixir. `DETAILS.md` carries the mapping matrix, the precedence rules, and the two places this workspace differs from the specification as it arrived.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2240  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-08T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-2240) '- W3C SVG 1.1 and 2.0; Lottie under IANA `video/lottie+json`
 # tags: rfd:references
 Text:RFD2240  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-08T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-2240) '- SMPTE VC-5, the CineForm intra-frame wavelet codec, and RFD66606-1123 which chose its SDK
 # tags: rfd:references
 Text:RFD2240  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-08T00:00:10Z (RFD66606-2240) '- Academy Software Foundation OpenTimelineIO and OpenColorIO 2
 # tags: rfd:references
 Text:RFD2240  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-08T00:00:11Z (RFD66606-2240) 'RFD66606-1123 (CineForm in Godot: the SDK over FFmpeg on licence), RFD66606-1137 (encoding a frame set, the working pair), RFD66606-2166 (the maskscore CineForm bundle), RFD66606-2239 (a row's artefacts as columns), RFD66606-2232 (documents rendered from a source).
 # tags: rfd:related
 Text:RFD2240  1 LINE
 Text:Written

