2026-09-08T00:00:26Z (RFD66606-2240) 'Every layer is an open standard with a permissive implementation the workspace can link. That is the same argument RFD66606-1123 made when it chose the CineForm SDK, which is `Apache-2.0 OR MIT`, over an LGPL alternative that a single-binary export cannot relink.
 # tags: rfd:details
